{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and pick up object, perform task, and drop object. Move to shelf and check. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToFrontOfShelf    /> <Action ID = CheckShelf    />\"",
